<section class="section section--border-top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-label">When It Gets Hard</div>
    <h2>Where being wrong is expensive.</h2>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--quad" style="margin-top: 2.5rem;">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="eyebrow">Human-AI Interaction</div>
        <h3>Defining what an exoskeleton decides, before the models could run it</h3>
        <p class="small">What the system surfaces to an operator under load, when it defers to the human, and how it fails safely. Secured $750K in research funding along the way.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="eyebrow">Life-Safety AI</div>
        <h3>Deciding where AI belongs in a 911 call center</h3>
        <p class="small">A wrong model output there costs a life. I built the governance criteria for making that call, and the vendor assessments behind it drove pilot and procurement decisions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="eyebrow">Delivery at Scale</div>
        <h3>Holding up to 14 concurrent programs to one set of delivery standards</h3>
        <p class="small">An org of 12 across five teams, working to the delivery standards I set.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="eyebrow">Institutional AI</div>
        <h3>Choosing an AI platform from 20+ vendors on weighted evidence</h3>
        <p class="small">Benchmark data, published weights, and a recommendation senior leadership used to set platform selection and a six-capability roadmap.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

